  Object cases Integer, Decimal have no valid discriminant.
  
  Runtime field "kind" overlaps between cases Integer and Decimal because
  number and number cannot be distinguished at runtime. Runtime field "value"
  overlaps between cases Integer and Decimal because number and number cannot
